{"id":"6be11bd4251b6ed3","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-set-extender-coherence-data.md","title":"Set Extender Sequence Ultrapower Adapter","display":"df-set-extender-coherence-data — Set Extender Sequence Ultrapower Adapter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-set-extender-coherence-data","aliases":["58-df-set-extender-coherence-data"],"display":"df-set-extender-coherence-data — Set Extender Sequence Ultrapower Adapter","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender-ultrapower.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-class-quotient-collapse.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-set-extender-coherence-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-set-extender-coherence-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-set-extender-coherence-data — Set Extender Sequence Ultrapower Adapter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c43e7408e2d17f49\" href=\"?note=c43e7408e2d17f49\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender-ultrapower.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender-ultrapower.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b1721f50aceb744e\" href=\"?note=b1721f50aceb744e\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-class-quotient-collapse.md\">../batch04/58-df-class-quotient-collapse.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\vec E,E\\in V\">\\(M,\\vec E,E\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,j\">\\(N,j\\)</span> 为元语言类，允许是集合的外延。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SetExtension}_{58}(A,a)\">\\(\\mathrm{SetExtension}_{58}(A,a)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的元素恰为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 的元素。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件仅为 <code>58-df-zfc-extender-sequence</code> 的已有集合模型接口给出四元转接；不把该接口换成细结构 premouse 的迭代树构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 的既有参数顺序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(j,N,M,E)\">\\((j,N,M,E)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4ExtenderUltrapower}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4ExtenderUltrapower}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c43e7408e2d17f49\" href=\"?note=c43e7408e2d17f49\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender-ultrapower.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender-ultrapower.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SetExtension}_{58}(A,a)\\leftrightarrow a\\in V\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow x\\in a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SetExtension}_{58}(A,a)\\leftrightarrow a\\in V\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow x\\in a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,N,M,E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists N_0,j_0,\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{SetExtension}_{58}(N,N_0)\\land\\mathrm{SetExtension}_{58}(j,j_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4ExtenderUltrapower}_S(M,E,N_0,\\kappa,\\lambda,j_0)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,N,M,E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists N_0,j_0,\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{SetExtension}_{58}(N,N_0)\\land\\mathrm{SetExtension}_{58}(j,j_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4ExtenderUltrapower}_S(M,E,N_0,\\kappa,\\lambda,j_0)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>书中被引用的 extender sequence 本身要求载体是传递集合 ZFC 模型；四元关系因此通过原有六元集合构造解释，不改变代表函数的取值范围，也不把集合序列定义改成另一种 premouse 定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender-ultrapower.md","status":"resolved","id":"c43e7408e2d17f49","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender-ultrapower.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-class-quotient-collapse.md","status":"resolved","id":"b1721f50aceb744e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-class-quotient-collapse.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender-ultrapower.md","status":"resolved","id":"c43e7408e2d17f49","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4ExtenderUltrapower}$ 取 [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender-ultrapower.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\vec E,E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"N,j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SetExtension}_{58}(A,a)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"(j,N,M,E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4ExtenderUltrapower}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SetExtension}_{58}(A,a)\\leftrightarrow a\\in V\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow x\\in a).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,N,M,E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists N_0,j_0,\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&\n\\mathrm{SetExtension}_{58}(N,N_0)\\land\\mathrm{SetExtension}_{58}(j,j_0)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4ExtenderUltrapower}_S(M,E,N_0,\\kappa,\\lambda,j_0)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1713,"backlinks":[{"id":"480c0affb5c0ccd9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set-extender-coherence-data.md|58-df-set-extender-coherence-data]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["c43e7408e2d17f49","b1721f50aceb744e"]}